  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large paella pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the onion, bell pepper, and zucchini, and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the rice and cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add the coconut milk, lime juice, orange juice, and score-fat. Bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the pan, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Stir in the white chocolate chips until melted.",
    "Transfer the paella to a serving platter, garnished with cilantro, and serve hot.",
    "Let the paella rest for a few minutes before serving, allowing the flavors to meld."
